1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:07,000
[WISTFUL MUSIC PLAYING]

2
00:00:17,300 --> 00:00:18,567
Thank you so much

3
00:00:18,567 --> 00:00:20,700
for paying
for my mother's surgery.

4
00:00:21,533 --> 00:00:25,333
It's the least I could do.

5
00:00:25,333 --> 00:00:32,167
[WISTFUL MUSIC CONTINUES]

6
00:00:37,300 --> 00:00:39,567
[INDISTINCT CHATTER]

7
00:00:40,400 --> 00:00:41,800
Where's Hannah?

8
00:00:41,800 --> 00:00:44,667
Oh. They already left, sir.

9
00:00:46,333 --> 00:00:52,433
[MUSIC BUILDING]

10
00:00:52,433 --> 00:00:56,167
[EXCITING MUSIC PLAYING]

11
00:00:56,167 --> 00:00:58,233
They just left a while ago.

12
00:01:04,700 --> 00:01:05,700
[CAR DOOR CLOSES]

13
00:01:06,800 --> 00:01:08,033
Oh, sir!

14
00:01:08,067 --> 00:01:09,433
Let us assist you, sir!

15
00:01:09,433 --> 00:01:11,800
We'll give you all
the assistance you need, sir!

16
00:01:18,100 --> 00:01:23,567
[EXCITING MUSIC CONTINUES]

17
00:01:23,567 --> 00:01:24,733
[DANIEL] Hannah!

18
00:01:26,100 --> 00:01:27,233
Hannah!

19
00:01:30,800 --> 00:01:32,233
Stop the car!

20
00:01:33,067 --> 00:01:34,133
Stop the car!

21
00:01:34,133 --> 00:01:35,467
[BRAKES SCREECH]

22
00:01:38,067 --> 00:01:42,167
[STIRRING MUSIC PLAYING]

23
00:01:42,200 --> 00:01:43,167
[CAR DOOR CLOSES]

24
00:01:50,633 --> 00:01:52,167
Don't go to Korea.

25
00:01:52,600 --> 00:01:54,500
Only the Chairman
is going to Korea

26
00:01:54,500 --> 00:01:56,633
after we visit my mother
in the hospital.

27
00:02:01,367 --> 00:02:02,367
Great.

28
00:02:03,267 --> 00:02:04,733
Because I'm staying here.

29
00:02:05,400 --> 00:02:12,200
[ROMANTIC MUSIC PLAYING]

30
00:02:23,267 --> 00:02:25,200
I'm half Filipino, Hannah.

31
00:02:27,600 --> 00:02:29,667
And I hated it all of my life.

32
00:02:32,200 --> 00:02:33,433
But because of you...

33
00:02:34,167 --> 00:02:36,867
[GIGGLING]

34
00:02:36,867 --> 00:02:38,333
[BANG ON DOOR]

35
00:02:38,333 --> 00:02:45,233
[ROMANTIC MUSIC CONTINUES]

36
00:02:47,200 --> 00:02:49,567
...I fell in love
with my other side.
